{"id": "en-r-9257y8.ru", "jokeId": "en-r-9257y8", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; twelve dollars became a thousand roubles, so half is five hundred. The husband hands the money over at the kitchen table.", "title": "Лотерея", "location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "scenes": [{"location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "table"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "zhena"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Что бы ты сделала, если бы я выиграл в лотерею?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Забрала бы половину и ушла от тебя.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Отлично. Я вчера выиграл тысячу рублей.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Вот тебе пятьсот.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.6}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Не пропадай.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-r-9257y8.de", "jokeId": "en-r-9257y8", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; twelve dollars became twelve euros, half is six. The husband hands the money over at the kitchen table.", "title": "Der Lottogewinn", "location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "scenes": [{"location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "table"}, {"type": "move", "who": "zhena", "to": "right"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "money", "action": "give", "to": "zhena"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "muzhik", "text": "Was würdest du tun, wenn ich im Lotto gewinnen würde?", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Ich würde die Hälfte nehmen und dich dann verlassen.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Super. Ich habe gestern zwölf Euro gewonnen.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Hier sind sechs.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.6}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Lass von dir hören.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-r-778fur.en", "jokeId": "en-r-778fur", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Kept all dialogue verbatim; narration trimmed slightly. The appraiser is the doctor puppet as a scientist with a monocle for the loupe; the call is staged with both holding phones in the appraiser's office.", "title": "The Inheritance", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman"}, "scenes": [{"location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "center"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "letter", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}, {"location": "ofis", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["muzhik", "doktor"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "doktor": "scientist"}, "looks": {"doktor": {"add": ["monocle"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "left"}, {"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "desk"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "doktor", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "One day a man hears that a distant uncle passed away.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "He's a little sad, but only a little, for they barely knew each other.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "A few days later, a package arrives with his inheritance: a violin and a painting.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "He has no idea what to do with them, so he takes them to an appraiser.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Not too long later the appraiser calls him.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "I've finished my analysis, and I've got some good news.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "There's no doubt at all that what you have is a genuine Van Gogh and a genuine Stradivarius.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "I can sell these for millions!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Well, you can sell them, and they'll fetch some money for their novelty value. But not millions.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "You see, the truth is, Stradivarius wasn't much of a painter... and Van Gogh made lousy violins.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-r-778fur.ru", "jokeId": "en-r-778fur", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; narration lightly trimmed. Appraiser is the doctor puppet as a scientist with a monocle; the call is staged with both holding phones in the appraiser's office.", "title": "Наследство", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman"}, "scenes": [{"location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "center"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "letter", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}, {"location": "ofis", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["muzhik", "doktor"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "doktor": "scientist"}, "looks": {"doktor": {"add": ["monocle"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "left"}, {"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "desk"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "doktor", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Однажды мужик узнаёт, что умер его дальний дядя.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Ему немного грустно, но только немного: они едва знали друг друга.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Через несколько дней приходит посылка с наследством: скрипка и картина.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Он понятия не имеет, что с ними делать, и несёт их к оценщику.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Вскоре оценщик ему звонит.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Я закончил экспертизу, и у меня для вас хорошие новости.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Нет ни малейших сомнений: у вас настоящий Ван Гог и настоящий Страдивари.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Я могу продать их за миллионы!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Ну, продать-то вы их можете, и какие-то деньги за них дадут, как за диковинку. Но не миллионы.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Видите ли, по правде говоря, Страдивари был так себе художник... а Ван Гог делал паршивые скрипки.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-r-778fur.de", "jokeId": "en-r-778fur", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; narration shortened to fit the word limit, dialogue complete. Appraiser is the doctor puppet as a scientist with a monocle; the call is staged with both holding phones in the appraiser's office.", "title": "Das Erbe", "location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman"}, "scenes": [{"location": "gostinaya", "cast": ["muzhik"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman"}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "center"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "letter", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l1"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l2"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l3"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l4"}]}, {"location": "ofis", "transition": "flyover", "cast": ["muzhik", "doktor"], "roles": {"muzhik": "everyman", "doktor": "scientist"}, "looks": {"doktor": {"add": ["monocle"]}}, "beats": [{"type": "move", "who": "muzhik", "to": "left"}, {"type": "move", "who": "doktor", "to": "desk"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "doktor", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "prop", "who": "muzhik", "item": "phone", "action": "hold"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l5"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l6"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l7"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l8"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l9"}, {"type": "line", "ref": "l10"}]}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Eines Tages erfährt ein Mann, dass ein entfernter Onkel gestorben ist.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Er ist nur ein bisschen traurig, denn sie kannten sich kaum.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Ein paar Tage später kommt ein Paket mit seinem Erbe: eine Geige und ein Gemälde.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Ratlos bringt er beides zu einem Gutachter.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Kurz darauf ruft der Gutachter an.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Ich habe meine Analyse abgeschlossen, und ich habe gute Nachrichten.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Es besteht nicht der geringste Zweifel: Sie besitzen einen echten Van Gogh und eine echte Stradivari.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Die kann ich für Millionen verkaufen!", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.4}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Nun ja, verkaufen können Sie sie, und als Kuriosität bringen sie auch etwas Geld. Aber keine Millionen.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.7}, {"character": "doktor", "text": "Wissen Sie, in Wahrheit war Stradivari kein großer Maler... und Van Gogh hat lausige Geigen gebaut.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-r-6vqagf.en", "jokeId": "en-r-6vqagf", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Dialogue verbatim; the first-person opening becomes one narrator line as the boss walks in. Boss in dark glasses, employee with a badge for the lanyard.", "title": "The Lamborghini", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "nachalnik": "boss"}, "looks": {"nachalnik": {"add": ["dark-glasses"]}, "paren": {"add": ["badge"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "The boss arrived at work in a brand-new Lamborghini.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["nachalnik"]}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Wow, that's an amazing car!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.6}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "If you work hard, put all your hours in, and strive for excellence, I'll get another one next year.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-r-6vqagf.ru", "jokeId": "en-r-6vqagf", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; the first-person opening becomes one narrator line as the boss walks in. Boss in dark glasses, employee with a badge.", "title": "Ламборгини", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "nachalnik": "boss"}, "looks": {"nachalnik": {"add": ["dark-glasses"]}, "paren": {"add": ["badge"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Начальник приехал на работу на новенькой Ламборгини.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["nachalnik"]}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Ух ты, потрясающая машина!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.6}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Если будешь усердно работать, отрабатывать все часы и стремиться к совершенству, в следующем году я куплю себе ещё одну.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-r-6vqagf.de", "jokeId": "en-r-6vqagf", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; the first-person opening becomes one narrator line as the boss walks in. Boss in dark glasses, employee with a badge.", "title": "Der Lamborghini", "location": "ulitsa", "cast": ["paren", "nachalnik"], "roles": {"paren": "employee", "nachalnik": "boss"}, "looks": {"nachalnik": {"add": ["dark-glasses"]}, "paren": {"add": ["badge"]}}, "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Der Chef kam in einem nagelneuen Lamborghini zur Arbeit.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3, "enter": ["nachalnik"]}, {"character": "paren", "text": "Wow, was für ein Wahnsinnsauto!", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.6}, {"character": "nachalnik", "text": "Wenn du hart arbeitest, alle deine Stunden reinsteckst und nach Exzellenz strebst, hole ich mir nächstes Jahr noch einen.", "emotion": "smug", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-r-5l3p32.en", "jokeId": "en-r-5l3p32", "locale": "en", "adaptation": "original", "notes": "Dialogue verbatim (typos fixed); first-person narration turned into third person, descriptions the picture shows cut. The husband wears only a towel, the wife curlers; the laughing toaster and the gun are requested, the punch is narrated because it is an action.", "title": "The Sleepwalker", "location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["towel"]}, "zhena": {"add": ["curlers"]}}, "needs": [{"kind": "prop", "id": "toaster", "description": "a chrome kitchen toaster on the table, with a sneaky face", "why": "the toaster laughs and gets shot in the punchline"}, {"kind": "prop", "id": "pistol", "description": "a cartoon pistol held in the hand", "why": "the husband is hunting Decepticons with a gun and shoots the toaster"}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "His wife found him in the kitchen, naked, holding a gun.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "What the hell are you doing?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Quiet, woman! I'm hunting Decepticons!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "You've been sleepwalking again! There's no such thing as Decepticons!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "I guess you're right! Man, I must look like an idiot!", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "She laughed. He laughed.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "The toaster laughed.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "He shot the toaster.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-r-5l3p32.ru", "jokeId": "en-r-5l3p32", "locale": "ru", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; first-person narration turned into third person. The husband wears only a towel, the wife curlers; the laughing toaster and the gun are requested, the punch is narrated because it is an action.", "title": "Лунатик", "location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["towel"]}, "zhena": {"add": ["curlers"]}}, "needs": [{"kind": "prop", "id": "toaster", "description": "a chrome kitchen toaster on the table, with a sneaky face", "why": "the toaster laughs and gets shot in the punchline"}, {"kind": "prop", "id": "pistol", "description": "a cartoon pistol held in the hand", "why": "the husband is hunting Decepticons with a gun and shoots the toaster"}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Жена застала мужа на кухне голым, с пистолетом в руке.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Ты что, чёрт возьми, делаешь?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Тихо, женщина! Я охочусь на десептиконов!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Ты опять ходил во сне! Никаких десептиконов не бывает!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Наверное, ты права! Господи, я, должно быть, выгляжу как идиот!", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Она засмеялась. Он засмеялся.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Тостер засмеялся.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Он застрелил тостер.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
{"id": "en-r-5l3p32.de", "jokeId": "en-r-5l3p32", "locale": "de", "adaptation": "direct", "notes": "Translated line by line; first-person narration turned into third person. The husband wears only a towel, the wife curlers; the laughing toaster and the gun are requested, the punch is narrated because it is an action.", "title": "Der Schlafwandler", "location": "kukhnya", "cast": ["muzhik", "zhena"], "roles": {"muzhik": "husband", "zhena": "wife"}, "looks": {"muzhik": {"add": ["towel"]}, "zhena": {"add": ["curlers"]}}, "needs": [{"kind": "prop", "id": "toaster", "description": "a chrome kitchen toaster on the table, with a sneaky face", "why": "the toaster laughs and gets shot in the punchline"}, {"kind": "prop", "id": "pistol", "description": "a cartoon pistol held in the hand", "why": "the husband is hunting Decepticons with a gun and shoots the toaster"}], "lines": [{"character": "narrator", "text": "Seine Frau fand ihn nackt in der Küche, mit einer Pistole in der Hand.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Was zum Teufel machst du da?", "emotion": "surprised", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Ruhe, Weib! Ich jage Decepticons!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "zhena", "text": "Du bist wieder schlafgewandelt! Es gibt keine Decepticons!", "emotion": "angry", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "muzhik", "text": "Du hast wohl recht! Mann, ich muss aussehen wie ein Idiot!", "emotion": "sad", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Sie lachte. Er lachte.", "emotion": "happy", "pauseAfterSec": 0.3}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Der Toaster lachte.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8}, {"character": "narrator", "text": "Er erschoss den Toaster.", "emotion": "neutral", "pauseAfterSec": 0.8, "laugh": "big"}]}
